<title>ISRAEL: Three Palestinians wounded in West Bank shooting.</title>
<headline>Three Palestinians wounded in West Bank shooting.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israelis fired on Palestinians a West Bank village near Jerusalem on Tuesday wounding three, Israel Radio said.</p>
<p>An army spokesman said he was checking the report of the shooting in the village of Hizmeh. No other details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
